# IMPORTANT: keep the derived bridge artifacts required for reproducibility.
# code/bridge/data/v1.0/ contains OSF-derived aggregate statistics that
# the bridge needs at runtime. Without these, generate.py cannot run.
!code/bridge/data/
!code/bridge/data/v1.0/
!code/bridge/data/v1.0/anchor_stats.npz
!code/bridge/data/v1.0/lda_fit.npz
!code/bridge/data/v1.0/qrec_embeddings.npz
